        <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
          <name>UseTermsOfPurchases</name>
          <id>3346</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>Terms of purchase</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>شرایط خرید</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Accordi con fornitori</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>Zamówienie do dostawców</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Соглашения с поставщиками</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Satın alma koşulları</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Thỏa thuận với nhà cung cấp</value>
          </title>
          <visible>true</visible>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
          <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
            <segments>ConstantsSet.UseTermsOfPurchases</segments>
          </dataPath>
          <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
          <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
          <handlers>
            <event>OnChange</event>
            <name>OnChangeAttribute</name>
          </handlers>
          <extendedTooltip>
            <name>UseTermsOfPurchasesExtendedTooltip</name>
            <id>3348</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Terms of purchase are purchase conditions for purchasing goods: price types, payment milestones, and other.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>شرایط خرید، شرایط خرید کالا هستند: انواع قیمت، مراحل پرداخت و غیره.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Gli accordi sono i Termini di acquisto utilizzati per gli acquisti di merci. In ogni accordo sono indicati i Termini di acquisto: tipi di prezzo, modalità di pagamento, ecc.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Porozumienia są to warunki zakupów, które są wykorzystywane podczas zakupu towarów. W każdym porozumieniu określa się warunki zakupu: rodzaje cen, harmonogram płatności itd.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Соглашения — это условия закупок, которые используются при закупках товаров. В каждом соглашении указываются условия закупок: виды цен, график оплаты и т.д.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Anlaşmalar, ürün satın alırken kullanılan satın alma koşullarıdır. Her anlaşma, satın alma şartlarını belirtir: fiyat türleri, ödeme planı vb.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Thỏa thuận là các điều kiện mua hàng được sử dụng khi mua hàng hóa. Trong mỗi thỏa thuận có thể chỉ ra các điều kiện mua hàng như: dạng giá, lịch thanh toán, v.v.</value>
            </title>
            <type>Label</type>
            <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
            <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
              <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
            </extInfo>
          </extendedTooltip>
          <contextMenu>
            <name>UseTermsOfPurchasesContextMenu</name>
            <id>3347</id>
            <autoFill>true</autoFill>
          </contextMenu>
          <type>CheckBoxField</type>
          <warningOnEdit>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>It is not recommended that you disable usage of terms of purchases after you start working with the application</value>
          </warningOnEdit>
          <warningOnEdit>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>توصیه نمی‌شود پس از شروع کار با برنامه، استفاده از شرایط خرید را غیرفعال کنید</value>
          </warningOnEdit>
          <warningOnEdit>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Отключать возможность использования соглашений с поставщиками после начала работы с системой не рекомендуется</value>
          </warningOnEdit>
          <warningOnEdit>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Sistemle çalışmaya başladıktan sonra satın alma koşullarını kullanma olanağının devre dışı bırakılması önerilmemektedir</value>
          </warningOnEdit>
          <warningOnEdit>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Không nên vô hiệu hóa khả năng sử dụng các đơn vị sau khi bắt đầu làm việc với hệ thống</value>
          </warningOnEdit>
          <warningOnEdit>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>It is not recommended that you disable usage of terms of purchases after you start working with the application</value>
          </warningOnEdit>
          <warningOnEdit>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>It is not recommended that you disable usage of terms of purchases after you start working with the application</value>
          </warningOnEdit>
          <editMode>Enter</editMode>
          <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
          <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
          <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
          <extInfo xsi:type="form:CheckBoxFieldExtInfo"/>
        </items>
