          <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
            <name>SimplifiedScheme</name>
            <id>3296</id>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
            <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
              <segments>ConstantsSet.UsePaymentStepsInPurchases</segments>
            </dataPath>
            <titleLocation>None</titleLocation>
            <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
            <handlers>
              <event>OnChange</event>
              <name>TheUseOfPaymentStepsInTheProcurementWhenChanging</name>
            </handlers>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>SimplifiedSchemeExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>3298</id>
              <title>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>You can split the payment into two milestones &quot;Before shipment&quot; and &quot;After shipment&quot; or select the payment only for one of them.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>می‌توانید پرداخت را به دو مرحله &quot;پیش از ارسال&quot; و &quot;پس از ارسال&quot; تقسیم کنید یا پرداخت را فقط برای یکی از آن‌ها انتخاب کنید.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>È possibile suddividere in due fase &quot;Prima della consegna&quot; e &quot;Dopo la consegna&quot; oppure selezionare il pagamento per uno solo di essi.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>Płatność można podzielić na dwa etapy &quot;Przed wysyłką&quot; i &quot;Po wysyłce&quot; lub wybrać płatność tylko według jednego z nich.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>Оплату можно разбить на два этапа &quot;До отгрузки&quot; и &quot;После отгрузки&quot; или выбрать оплату только по одному из них.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>Ödeme, &quot;Sevkiyat öncesi&quot; ve &quot;Sevkiyat sonrası&quot; olmak üzere iki aşamaya ayrılabilir veya yalnızca biri için ödeme yapmayı seçebilirsiniz.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>Có thể chia khoản thanh toán thành hai giai đoạn &quot;Trước khi giao hàng&quot; và &quot;Sau khi giao hàng&quot; hoặc chỉ chọn thanh toán theo một trong các giai đoạn trên.</value>
              </title>
              <type>Label</type>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
              </extInfo>
            </extendedTooltip>
            <contextMenu>
              <name>SimplifiedSchemeContextMenu</name>
              <id>3297</id>
              <autoFill>true</autoFill>
            </contextMenu>
            <type>RadioButtonField</type>
            <warningOnEditRepresentation>Show</warningOnEditRepresentation>
            <warningOnEdit>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>It is not recommended that you change payment planning mode after you have started working with the application</value>
            </warningOnEdit>
            <warningOnEdit>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>توصیه نمی‌شود پس از شروع کار با برنامه، حالت برنامه‌ریزی پرداخت را تغییر دهید</value>
            </warningOnEdit>
            <warningOnEdit>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Non è consigliabile cambiare la modalità di pianificazione del pagamento dopo l'avvio del sistema</value>
            </warningOnEdit>
            <warningOnEdit>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Nie zaleca się zmiany trybu planowania płatności po rozpoczęciu pracy z systemem</value>
            </warningOnEdit>
            <warningOnEdit>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Изменять режим планирования оплаты после начала работы с системой не рекомендуется</value>
            </warningOnEdit>
            <warningOnEdit>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Sistemle işe başladıktan sonra ödeme planlama modunun değiştirilmesi önerilmemektedir.</value>
            </warningOnEdit>
            <warningOnEdit>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Không nên thay đổi chế độ lập kế hoạch thanh toán sau khi bắt đầu làm việc với hệ thống</value>
            </warningOnEdit>
            <editMode>Enter</editMode>
            <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
            <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
            <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:RadioButtonsFieldExtInfo">
              <choiceList>
                <presentation>
                  <key>en</key>
                  <value>Payment before or after shipment</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>fa</key>
                  <value>پرداخت پیش یا پس از ارسال</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>it</key>
                  <value>Pagamento prima della consegna e/o dopo la consegna</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>pl</key>
                  <value>Płatność do wysyłki i/lub po wysyłce</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>ru</key>
                  <value>Оплата до отгрузки и/или после отгрузки</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>tr</key>
                  <value>Sevkiyattan önce ve/veya sevkiyattan sonra</value>
                </presentation>
                <presentation>
                  <key>vi</key>
                  <value>Thanh toán trước khi giao hàng và/hoặc sau khi giao hàng</value>
                </presentation>
                <value xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
                  <value>Enum.UsePaymentSteps.EnumValue.SimplifiedScheme</value>
                </value>
              </choiceList>
